  <p>
    Most gardening advice online is written for American or British weather.
    It tells you to sow in "spring" without saying what that means for a
    terrace in North India, or which products you can actually buy here.
    FreshFynds exists to fix that: practical guides written for Indian
    seasons, Indian homes and Indian prices.
  </p>

  <h2>How I choose what to recommend</h2>
  <p>
    I recommend products based on what I have used, careful research, and
    what other Indian gardeners report. If something has a real drawback, I
    say so. Some links on this site are affiliate links, which is how the site
    pays for itself. You can read more in the
    <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    Questions, corrections or a gardening problem you want covered? Visit the
    <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>
